<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="799190077"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:34.493"><div begin="10.180" end="33.908" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="10.180" end="14.678" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.180" end="11.414">黄昏后</span><span begin="11.414" end="11.908">人</span><span begin="11.908" end="12.388">潮</span><span begin="12.388" end="12.800">散</span><span begin="12.800" end="14.678">开</span></p><p begin="15.160" end="19.525" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.160" end="17.148">躲在人群里</span><span begin="17.148" end="17.628">发</span><span begin="17.628" end="19.525">呆</span></p><p begin="19.942" end="24.398" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.942" end="22.053">看见你走过</span><span begin="22.053" end="24.398">来</span></p><p begin="24.750" end="28.675" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.750" end="26.764">有好多的期</span><span begin="26.764" end="28.675">待</span></p><p begin="29.077" end="33.908" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.077" end="29.735">我应</span><span begin="29.735" end="33.908">该</span></p></div><div begin="39.306" end="1:06.129" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="39.306" end="43.567" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.306" end="39.855">天</span><span begin="39.855" end="40.550">空被</span><span begin="40.550" end="41.076">蓝</span><span begin="41.076" end="41.833">色晕</span><span begin="41.833" end="43.567">开</span></p><p begin="44.159" end="48.743" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.159" end="44.635">我</span><span begin="44.635" end="46.704">们聊得好灿</span><span begin="46.704" end="48.743">烂</span></p><p begin="49.162" end="53.604" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.162" end="49.994">怀疑</span><span begin="49.994" end="50.437">美好</span><span begin="50.437" end="51.172">的现</span><span begin="51.172" end="53.604">在</span></p><p begin="54.001" end="57.795" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.001" end="54.801">是否</span><span begin="54.801" end="55.292">应该</spa